Circuit breaker practical -

spring-cloud-starter-circuitbreaker-reactor-resilience4j  - dependency

add code in yml -

       - name: CircuitBreaker
         args:
            name: productServiceCircuitBreaker
            fallbackUri: forward:/fallback/product

then manually disabled product service and run end point what is related to product - http://localhost:5000/categories
it will call the fallback url and displaye message there 'Product service is currently unavailable. Please try again later.'


