service discovery ko kaise pata chalata hai ki service available hai kya nahi -

Interview point: Eureka primarily uses heartbeats to detect availability.
It does not automatically check an application's actual health endpoint unless additional health-check integration is configured.

Lease renewal (Heartbeat)


Eureka determines service health through Lease Renewals (Heartbeats).
• Heartbeat interval: Each service instance sends a signal every 30 seconds by default.
• Expiration deadline: If Eureka receives no heartbeat for 90 seconds, it assumes the instance is dead.
• Action taken: Eureka marks the service as DOWN or removes it from the registry (unless self-preservation is active).

eureka:
  instance:
    lease-renewal-interval-in-seconds: 30
    lease-expiration-duration-in-seconds: 90

step 1 - add this in discovery properties file -

 eureka.server.eviction-interval-timer-in-ms=60000  it will check every 6 sec its the instance is active or not- in discovery server

    eureka.instance.lease-renewal-interval-in-seconds=30  - every 30 sec eo beat bhejata jayega   other services
    eureka.instance.lease-expiration-duration-in-seconds=90  -  90 sec agar down ho gaya to servce discovery wo lega nahi remove kar dega

    #  90 sec tak service discover heart beat nahi mila to wo service discovery portal se remove ho jayegi agar if
      # self preservation is off

#####################################################

what is mean by self preservation mode in Eureka ?

Self-Preservation mode in Eureka is a safety mechanism that protects the system from mass deregistration during temporary network issues.
• How it works: If many services suddenly fail to send heartbeats, Eureka assumes a network partition rather than actual service failures and avoids removing them from the registry.
• Configuration:yaml
eureka:
  server:
    enable-self-preservation: true
    renewal-percent-threshold: 0.85 # 85% of expected heartbeats required
    eviction-interval-timer-in-ms: 60000 # Check every 60 sec to evict expired leas


    agar 100 me se 5 to 10 percent faild ho rage hai service to wo self preservation mode false hoga and wo services rwmove ho jayege
    but agar 30 to 40 prrcet hoga as per provided thershold to samaj jayega there might be netwoerk issue so it will set self preservation mode true